e=\\\"12\\\" font-weight=\\\"bold\\\" text-anchor=\\\"middle\\\">θ0</text><text x=\\\"58.0\\\" y=\\\"16\\\" fill=\\\"#9a9ab0\\\" font-size=\\\"11\\\">each line is dR/dθ at that guess; its x-intercept is the next guess</text><text x=\\\"58.0\\\" y=\\\"34\\\" fill=\\\"#7fd8ff\\\" font-size=\\\"13\\\" font-weight=\\\"bold\\\">iteration 0  ·  θ = 0.1500 rad (8.59°)  ·  miss = 34.63 m</text><text x=\\\"398.0\\\" y=\\\"338.0\\\" fill=\\\"#8a8aa0\\\" font-size=\\\"11\\\" text-anchor=\\\"middle\\\">launch angle (rad)</text><text x=\\\"14\\\" y=\\\"172.0\\\" fill=\\\"#8a8aa0\\\" font-size=\\\"11\\\" text-anchor=\\\"middle\\\" transform=\\\"rotate(-90 14 172.0)\\\">range (m)</text></svg>\"}}]"
